<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sensor> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/ObservableProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relación entre un sensor y una propiedad observable que es capaz de detectar."@es .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "observa"@es .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "observes"@en .
