<https://edint.es/def/censovehiculos#Vehicle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Self-propelled transport device, along with any attachments, e.g. trailers, that is a legal user of the transportation network (Source: ISO/TS 19091:2019(en))."@en .
