<https://edint.es/def/infraestructura#Facility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "It refers to service buildings (public or private), leisure areas, commercial areas or any other element that directly affects mobility, acting as a focus of attraction for persons or vehicles."@en .
<https://edint.es/def/infraestructura#Facility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Equipamiento"@es .
<https://edint.es/def/infraestructura#Facility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Facility"@en .
